      "blocks": {
        "item_wcJdcg": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/dfg.png",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Sophie M.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>I ordered this bear for my daughter's 19th birthday. When she discovered the hidden necklace with her initials... she burst into tears! The rose is gorgeous and the necklace is great quality. Fast shipping, 100% recommend.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_mP3d3L": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/fvzs1IMoz_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Marc L.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>My girlfriend didn't see it coming at all! The surprise effect is amazing — it took her 5 minutes to figure out she had to turn the rose 😅 The necklace with the date we met engraved is perfect. Gift nailed!</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_P6jYc7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/guz1RtPFjZ_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Emma R.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>Perfect Valentine's Day gift! The rose is really beautiful and looks delicate, but it's actually sturdy. My boyfriend had 'E♡T Forever' engraved and it's exactly what I was hoping for. I wear it every day.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_jxk4nh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CUHycauCrF_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Julie D.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>For our 5th anniversary with my husband, I chose the red rose with the rose gold necklace. The engraving of our wedding date is crisp and legible. The packaging was beautiful. A keepsake we'll treasure for life!</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "item_pyz4pT": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/OTTQViMNB_mid.jpg",
            "column_size": "3",
            "title": "Thomas B.",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p>My mom loved it! I gave it to her for Mother's Day with 'Mom ♥' engraved. She put it on her dresser and shows the necklace to all her friends. Very happy with my purchase, thank you Soraya Paris.</p>",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
